<div class="wrap page-head"><span class="eyebrow">Incentives</span><h1>Tax bonuses and deductions</h1><p class="lead">Many renovation works qualify for a tax deduction in Italy. We help you understand which works are eligible and prepare the documents you need.</p></div>
<section class="band white"><div class="wrap split">
  <div class="stack"><h2>What we do for you</h2>
    <ul class="list"><li>We tell you which items in the quote can be deducted</li><li>We issue invoices with the correct wording</li><li>We remind you how to pay, with the required bank transfer (bonifico parlante)</li><li>We work with your accountant or surveyor</li></ul>
  </div>
  <div class="stack"><h2>The rules change often</h2><p>Bonus rates and limits change almost every year with the budget law. When we give you the quote, we tell you which rules apply to your job. For your own tax situation, your accountant has the final word.</p><p>Official information (in Italian) is on the <a href="https://www.agenziaentrate.gov.it/portale/aree-tematiche/casa/agevolazioni">Agenzia delle Entrate</a> website.</p></div>
</div></section>
